        "notes": "Néstor makes one tortilla at 13:00 and one at 20:00, twelve slices each, and that is the entire supply. You put your name on the list at noon or you do not eat it. Order the tomato salad and a txuleta while you wait — that is the actual meal; the tortilla is a slice.",
